graph TD
    User([Usuario])

    subgraph "Hilo Principal (Browser Main Thread)"
        UI["UI (Vue 3 / Components)"]
        State["Application State (Pinia)"]
        RPCClient["Repository RPC Client"]
    end

    subgraph "SharedWorker (Background)"
        SyncHost["Sync Host & Orchestrator"]
        SQLite[(Local Storage / wa-sqlite)]
        Outbox["Outbox Runner"]
        JMAPAdapter["JMAP Backend / Transport"]
    end

    Server((Servidor JMAP))

    User -->|Interactúa| UI
    UI -->|Lee/Mutaciones| State
    State -->|Mensajes RPC| RPCClient
    RPCClient -- "MessagePort (async)" --> SyncHost
    SyncHost -->|Lee/Escribe| SQLite
    SQLite -. "BroadcastChannel (TABLES_TOUCHED)" .-> State
    
    SyncHost -->|Inicia tareas| Outbox
    SyncHost -->|Delega llamadas red| JMAPAdapter
    Outbox -->|Procesa pendientes| JMAPAdapter
    
    JMAPAdapter -- "HTTPS / WebSocket" --> Server
